                  "content": "# Vercel AI SDK static boundary\n\n`supportAgent` calls `generateText(buildRequest(prompt))`. The request is assembled indirectly, and `prepareStep` can load and replace instructions.\n\nThe project-local static adapter recognizes directly exported functions containing a direct `generateText({ ... })` or `streamText({ ... })` call. For direct instruction loading, it recognizes `instructions` and the closed direct-generation `system` fallback. It does not establish the indirect request-builder form used here.\n\nKeep the current integration as implemented. If deterministic static evidence becomes necessary, first preserve the intended step behavior, then move to the supported direct-call pattern recorded in the support agent's unresolved warning.\n",
